<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<span data-teams="true" style=""><span data-teams="true" style=""><span data-teams="true" style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font style="" size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear&nbsp;<o:p></o:p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!DirectDebitRequest__c.CustomerAccountName__c},</span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Greetings from Modon.<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">This is to confirm that your <b>Direct Debit Mandate has
been successfully cancelled</b>.<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Direct Debit Reference:</b>&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!DirectDebitRequest__c.DDA_Reference_Number__c}</span><br>
<b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Mandate Status:</b> Cancelled<br>
<b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Cancellation Date:</b>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!DirectDebitRequest__c.Bank_Cancellation_Date__c}</span></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">No further collections will be initiated under this mandate,
subject to any transactions already submitted for processing prior to the
effective cancellation.<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">For any assistance regarding your payment arrangements,
please contact Modon Customer Services.<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font style="" size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Regards,<br>
<b style="">Modon Real Estate</b><br>
Customer Payment Services</font><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;"><o:p></o:p></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p></span></span></span>]]></td>
